{"type":"message","id":"08ba1efd","parentId":"0918b670","timestamp":"2026-03-16T15:42:19.261Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Creating health conversation skill**\n\nI’m thinking through creating a skill that requires some coding, probably in Python using the Hugging Face Inference API. It should accept conversation context and possibly a diagnosis file. The script will summarize conversations and tool outputs, and then call the HF chat completion endpoint with a prompt. I’m considering the model meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct. I want to ensure the script has no external dependencies. I'll set a token placeholder and write the skill accordingly. Let's get to scripting!\n\n**Writing the chat skill**\n\nI'm focusing on creating a script that can read context and diagnosis from files or arguments. It will assemble system and user messages, then call the Hugging Face API, possibly something openai-compatible. I think I'll need to use urllib to handle requests. There should also be options for model selection, temperature settings, and max tokens. It feels like I'm gathering all the pieces together, so let’s jump in and start writing this up!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_02ef2077f831295d0169b8249ace648191ba71b60c6e481d6a\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuCTbFaEqS_LAeozuULHqYXzrdzdQYlZ7Kq4DDJiDe3dMnC0iAnt-m2hYs213zBkPT48PV3448AIlSys_-KxMNDDIYuStaG8710Qiqk65aYJ8qg6e6H8B2SKsvqv-MDtPphG4oAOZ9RGMkTErbftQ21pT5PYZcE_PlWj76AhEhbpjLI5zFslUfVNUItYuPvj6Zpzrjabt5xPlc_GEyg0oc0_rBv3wuw9-eer6QZ3xbwl0etFi7_s_OqHotx3xkJ7vv2fQYcj6paqMEdBTYvKrP0Oqm-RWSTnusNMSBG6zTqR0l6y4Ez5x5TCH1sPfQ0oJnltNAOxpZbHFOvYlrQSm8Sk2GTZxse71A0XohZhbt_a-vqWy0t0M7NsUhH6Smnez-Id57z_dPGeocHZ-YFpddOGvaxy8VQsgqoYLBQMVLRxvLfwmD3IOQrfQkRw0D20jkc1TDtveHC0Ro1wi5666qqisAnJAFnKQqAY_hOyn55ETe78nCPo0XRyKua3_aH9baAWdBlLKGzMtaZiYdf2LR4fapTvvqmY9y3CloBdUQHuL8SbbOHcNEsMXUWavCnSUzxHncnDQpl1mLIQ2pejFkd2T0t9gm7iXwq0AT9XRfm_8gYWLbLO-PBV1YXckC1xTz4GTTkdToJ8i_r5