h_response.py \\\n  --context-file /tmp/health_context.txt \\\n  --diagnosis-file /tmp/diagnosis_output.txt\n```\n\nOr with direct text:\n```bash\npython3 /home/node/.openclaw/skills/llm-distillator/scripts/distill_health_response.py \\\n  --context \"Patient reports right flank pain for 2 weeks, intermittent blood in urine, no fever.\" \\\n  --diagnosis \"Kidney scan classifier output: suspicious lesion detected, confidence 0.81.\"\n```\n\nOne note: I tried to commit the packaged artifact, but `/home/node/.openclaw/workspace` is not a git repo, so there was nothing I could commit there. If you want, I can also make a second version named exactly `llm_distillator` with underscores instead of the normalized hyphenated skill name.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02ef2077f831295d0169b824efa12c8191818edbdeff49e173\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":157,"output":380,"cacheRead":18944,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19481,"cost":{"input":0.00039250000000000005,"output":0.0057,"cacheRead":0.004736,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010828500000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773675754163}}
