{"type":"message","id":"0fa94f37","parentId":"2ec7ea55","timestamp":"2026-03-16T16:08:43.390Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I ran it with a made-up case, and the script itself works up to the expected token check.\n\nResult:\n```text\nSet HUGGING_FACE_TOKEN (or HF_TOKEN) in the environment, or replace HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER in the script with your real token.\n```\n\nSo the current status is:\n- argument parsing: works\n- context/diagnosis assembly: works\n- API-call path: reached\n- actual model response: blocked only because the Hugging Face token is still unset\n\nIf you want, I can do either of these next:\n1. run a dry test with `--print-prompt` so you can inspect the exact prompt it would send, or\n2. help you wire in your Hugging Face token and then run a real live test.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02ef2077f831295d0169b82b0845c48191982acaceac9158ec\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":150,"output":169,"cacheRead":19200,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19519,"cost":{"input":0.000375,"output":0.002535,"cacheRead":0.0048,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00771}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773677315519}}
